  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム 逆襲のシャア』に登場する量産型MSジェガンがMG化！",
      "en": "The mass-produced MS Jegan that appears in \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack\" is now an MG!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 『逆襲のシャア』に登場したシルエットバランスを踏襲し、ずっしりと安定感のあるジェガンを再現！",
      "en": "• Following the silhouette balance that appeared in \"Char's Counterattack\", we reproduce the heavy and stable Jegan!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 完全新規造形のMS内部フレームが採用され、量産機を象徴する内部骨格を組み立てるだけで再現できる！",
      "en": "• A completely newly shaped MS internal frame is adopted, allowing you to reproduce the internal skeleton that symbolizes mass-produced machines just by using Assembly!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 左右4種類ずつのハンドパーツが付属し、ライフルを構えるポーズからアクシズに取りつく名シーンまで再現可能！",
      "en": "• Four types of hand parts on the left and right sides are included, allowing you to recreate everything from the pose of holding a rifle to the famous scene of him clinging to Axis!"
    }
  ],
